the European Commission is working  around the clock to help address the  coronavirus crisis we're funding  research we are financing the  development of vaccines we support  companies and people who risk losing  their jobs but sometimes the support  from the European Union is even more  concrete I'm very happy that this  morning we were able to repatriate 290  European citizens who were stranded in  Morocco the plane that brought them home  landed safely in Vienna on board were  Austrians and other US citizens as well  and this morning Austria submitted a  second request for repatriation flight  for EU citizens from Morocco and we will  support it too but EU citizens are not  only stranded outside but also within  Europe and this needs to stop we have  proposed solutions to enable people to  go home now and allow the transport of  goods that are needed across Europe we  have to keep cross-border transport of  supplies flowing in particular that of  medical products throughout Europe there  is a big need for masks protective suits  and other equipment to protect ourselves  from the virus we need in particular to  take care of our health care workers  doctors and nurses but also police and  border guards we work with the industry  to produce more protective equipment and  we work with national governments to buy  this stuff together in addition we are  accelerating research yesterday I spoke  to the managers of an innovative  European research company they work on a  promising technology to develop a  vaccine against the corona virus the  European Union provides them up to 80  million euros and I hope that with this  report we can have a vaccine on the  market perhaps before autumn this could  save lives in Europe and in the rest of  the world too  and tonight I will discuss with the  European heads of state and government  about new measures to support the  economy much remains to be done to fight  this virus we can all contribute for  example you can contribute by staying  home and reducing contact with other  people thank you for your support
 

